reen cross on the left.\nNow I'm in the same row as the green crosses. Let me try moving LEFT to get closer to the green crosses, or try clicking on the 4th green cross which is now adjacent to the player.\nActually, looking at the image, the player is to the RIGHT of the 4th green cross. So the green cross is at column 44 and the player is at column 56 (or similar). Let me try moving LEFT to get adjacent to the green cross.\nBut wait - in the bottom panel, the player couldn't move onto the green cross cell. Maybe the same applies here. Let me try moving LEFT to see if I can move within the top panel.", "kind": "reasoning", "inContext": false}, {"label": "TOOL CALL: python", "content": "<tool_call>\n<function=python>\n<parameter=code>\n# Check player position\nseg = current_frame.segmentation\nnodes = seg['nodes']\nfor n in nodes:\n    if n['color'] in ('Y', 'O'):\n        rows = [p[0] for p in n['boundary']]\n        cols = [p[1] for p in n['boundary']]\n        print(f\"Player: color={n['color']}, center\u2248({sum(rows)//len(rows)}, {sum(cols)//len(cols)})\")\n\n# Try moving LEFT to approach the green cross\naction(['LEFT'])\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "TOOL RESULT: python", "content": "Player: color=Y, center\u2248(16, 56)\nPlayer: color=O, center\u2248(16, 56)", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}], "hasExactModelContext": false, "requestIndexWithinTurn": null, "messageCount": 0}}}